              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Peggianne"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have made this recipe for 30 years or better. It was in my husbands family recipes when I met him. To avoid the tinny taste it may have due to the onions being juiced, so to speak, after it sets a few days in the fridge, I use onion powder. If you are using it all right away, use the real onions. Just my opinion.",
